style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>       30,779 </strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>       12,939 </strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>       35,230 </strong></td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Income taxes</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">             439 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">             179 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">             140 </td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Net income before income taxes</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       31,218 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       13,118 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       35,370 </td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Depreciation and amortization</td><td style="width