<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Golar LNG Limited announces that it has filed its Form 20-F for the year ended December 31, 2024 with the Securities and Exchange Commission in the U.S.</p>  <p align="justify">Form 20-F can be downloaded from the link below, is available on our website (<a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=P0AF3nJezf_ZFOXT4nyn4fOfr_nXzTuYFELdwTnoSQgDhcSQTvN8zMdYZoRLKsNFc__iT8SnFVg-EVkeXljJcqRLrP__fNJN8xjbxqfB-Oc=" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.golarlng.com</a>) and shareholders may receive a hard copy free of charge upon request.  </p>  <p>March 27, 2025<br /> The Board of Directors<br /> Hamilton, Bermuda<br />Enquiries:<br />Golar Management Limited: + 44 207 063 7900<br />Stuart Buchanan</p>  <p>This information is subject to the disclosure requirements pursuant to Section 5-12 the Norwegian Securities Trading Act</p>  <p> <br /></p> <p id="gnw_attachments_section-header"><br>    <strong>Attachment</strong><br></p><br><ul id="gnw_attachments_section-items"><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/e3ee94eb-6be6-4849-9fef-9b7db2dbe8c8">GLNG 2024 Annual Report Form 20-F</a><br>      </li><br>      </ul><br><img alt="" class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMTA3NjYzNiM0MDIxMDM1NzUjMjAwMzUzOQ==" /> <br/><img  alt="" src="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/media/N2ZjMmQ3NGUtNzk5Yy00NGQ3LWJmMmQtMGQwYjJiZDVhMmViLTEwMTUxMTItMjAyNS0wMy0yNy1lbg==/tiny/Golar-LNG.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" /></p></td>
