><td colspan="4" style="width:268.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>Jul-Sep</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="width:396.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; "><em>(in thousands of $)</em></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; "><strong>FLNG</strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; "><strong>Corporate and other</strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; "><strong>Shipping</strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; "><strong>Total</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="width:396.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Total operating revenues</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       56,391 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">         5,532 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">         5,329 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       67,252 </td></tr><tr><td style="width:396.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bott