<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Golar LNG Limited advises that its 2024 Annual General Meeting will be held on Tuesday August 13, 2024.  The record date for voting at the Annual General Meeting is set to June 13, 2024. The notice, agenda and associated material will be distributed prior to the meeting.</p>  <p>Golar LNG Limited<br />Hamilton, Bermuda<br />June 10, 2024</p>  <p>This information is subject to the disclosure requirements pursuant to Section 5-12 the Norwegian Securities Trading Act</p> <img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMDk2NTUwNyM0MDE4NjgzNzcjMjAwMzUzOQ=="/> <br/><img src="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/media/ZGM3ODE5NWEtZmU4Zi00OWYxLWI5NWYtNzY5OTJjMGU5Zjk1LTEwMTUxMTI=/tiny/Golar-LNG.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" /></p></td>
