<td><h2>Golar LNG Limited  Q1 2024 results presentation</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2024-04-25 20:50:01</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Golar LNG's 1<sup>st</sup> Quarter 2024 results will be released before the NASDAQ opens on Tuesday, May 28, 2024. In connection with this a webcast presentation will be held at <strong>1:00 P.M (London Time</strong>) on Tuesday May 28, 2024. The presentation will be available to download from the Investor Relations section at <a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=9wKjSwjlSEPToDqzgaLgC-jN2Fn7SpmIVi_YbODx6RNFyVNLUtJBif7N-aUI3WwArUeEERJjHxqj1Morx4GeoK6jFzbGPs2dGg5IPHNKJBpIa_YSk3Xr_ezcu-iQIJzgYyXNQN5tbyN6lngcdYfLbF-EUJBFSkEx-L8liEhru9vfdNcAp7dZi5vqBA0-lFdYWhvXwNMcc7tNV2_hvH7ZrVTALCbesKOgGT0fpVhNHAHwjwiquJ__d88XUXGu35MZ8nFWhqsfzHP82rXJl1wFgL0UPLP6FD4v_yQRgiwEcV3w42JpnccIv9X16p_OD5HNB90cEqWQai3ky8KZin0JV6JkZOkkaPBIv6CYTyd1jnx7jmExkptus3D_3ieYytlp6bvJxeX_PvXEhzvvypXnI5hnYq6s0cgGC8I7ODuPTsMfMwOAnL650TZ_BajL739aX1PXOo_wTRYcFZUI1b2SuEDKqcWUlGXQUbQfDq0PWbVKBqXA9ZCIyrVzrHk6ahX0nTY72EIP7Fk446W3Mw7H6SEmK1wKerJHn05ajbHe-hEHGFyogwbcX0D8uKfqnytPFKFN9Vw3OY93jSkKF4I-TA==" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><u>www.golarlng.com</u></a></p>  <p align="justify">We recommend that participants join the conference call via the listen-only live webcast link provided. Sell-side analysts interested in raising a question during the Q&amp;A session that will immediately follow the presentation should access the event via the conference call by clicking on this <a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=PbFc5RDLwqeRvhAtmJV5Ko2D5_MqsG3_Ca0kSABCCgC4wMBWfQlWbpBQp0ntyDOn8CeKRC6pR0KsvzKT2_ncUjotinbnsP-cEOFilpPvvY8qb8a_vdxR_SKjnPHKjATy-O4gDMEwQT3BRq1cNrw5TQ==" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link</a>. We recommend connecting 10 minutes prior to the call start. Information on how to ask questions will be given at the beginning of the Q&amp;A session. There will be a limit of two questions per participant.</p>  <p><strong>a. Listen-only live webcast</strong> <strong>link</strong><br /> Go to the Investors, Results Centre section at <a href="https://