vertical-align: bottom ; ">Less: Golar Partners, Seatriums and B&amp;Vs share of the FLNG Hilli contractual debt</td><td style="width:79.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">         (32,610)</td><td style="width:79.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">         (33,185)</td><td style="width:79.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (358,484)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:427.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Less: Keppels share of the Gimi debt</td><td style="width:79.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (189,000)</td><td style="width:79.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (189,000)</td><td style="width:79.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (160,500)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:427.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>Golar's share of Contractual Debt</strong></td><td style="width:79.00</p></td>
