</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Golar LNG Limited announces that it has filed its Form 20-F for the year ended December 31, 2022 with the Securities and Exchange Commission in the U.S.</p>  <p align="justify">Form 20-F can be downloaded from the link below, is available on our website (<a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=CeT_Zml8u2Yxt1jA2vDFvhidg3YlJJ9r-aQewCtYzdoV5nurP8DIZS369GyzevgomAm1ABTqERFcmEMnxtkpvA==" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><u>www.golarlng.com</u></a>) and shareholders may receive a hard copy free of charge upon request.  </p>  <p>March 31, 2023<br /> The Board of Directors<br /> Hamilton, Bermuda<br />Enquiries:<br />Golar Management Limited: + 44 207 063 7900<br />Stuart Buchanan</p>  <p>This information is subject to the disclosure requirements pursuant to Section 5-12 the Norwegian Securities Trading Act</p> <p id="gnw_attachments_section-header"><br>    <strong>Attachment</strong><br></p><br><ul id="gnw_attachments_section-items"><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/b7cdeda8-00e7-48ef-936c-a4c454e670ab">GLNG 2022 Annual Report Form 20-F</a><br>      </li><br>      </ul><br><img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMDgwMTYzOCM0MDE1MTkzMDAjMjAwMzUzOQ=="/> <br/><img src="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/media/OTc1YjdiOTMtZDJlMy00ODc4LTljODQtZDhmYTdiYjM2MjQ1LTEwMTUxMTI=/tiny/Golar-LNG.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" /></p></td>
