="width:72.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">2,239,497</td><td style="width:72.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">(62)%</td></tr></table> <p align="justify"><strong>Financial Review</strong></p>  <p align="justify"><em>Business Performance:</em></p> <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width:664; border-collapse:collapse ;"><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; "> </td><td colspan="2" style="width:134.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>2022</strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>2021</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; "> </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>Oct-Dec</strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-top: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>Jul-Sep</strong></td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: center ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; "><strong>Oct-Dec</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-bottom: solid black 1pt ; border-l