urities</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">     (54,469)</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">     (51,449)</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       51,566 </td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Other non-operating income</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">           (649)</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (1,244)</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (1,554)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Interest income</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (8,212)</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">       (3,059)</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-right: solid black 1pt ; border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">             (66)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:463.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; vertical-align: bottom ; ">Interest expense</td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt ; text-align: right ;  vertical-align: middle; vertical-align: bottom ; ">         3,697 </td><td style="width:67.00px;;border-left: solid black 1pt