<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Further to the press release of June 8, 2021 giving notice that the Golar LNG Limited 2021 Annual General Meeting will be held on August 10, 2021, a copy of the Notice of Annual General Meeting and associated information including the Companys Annual Report on Form 20-F can be found on our website at <a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=gk2DZ0Z4mrrUsFbgwtybgsyvh66cPkbuqhAgPU-2SmlIztjBAmy4TdTqRch-FcgVShzkGsYnJpaPIMdrp3lLuJCqiIyn4i-cLYzbFL9QO8Y=" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">http://www.golarlng.com</a> and in the attachments below.</p>  <p>Golar LNG Limited<br />Hamilton, Bermuda<br />June 28, 2021</p> <p id="gnw_attachments_section-header"><br>    <strong>Attachments</strong><br></p><br><ul id="gnw_attachments_section-items"><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/5faeaaf9-5faa-4678-b330-e34398d19831">Notice of 2021 Annual General Meeting</a><br>      </li><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/e5224563-8fc2-4dab-afae-1a669b202db1">2020 Annual Report Form 20-F</a><br>      </li><br>      </ul><br><img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMDUxMzE3NCM0MDA5NzM4MDgjMjAwMzUzOQ==" width="1" height="1"/> <br/><img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/release/track/916a816c-2026-4213-b873-45f891192415" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" width="1" height="1" style="display:none;" /></p></td>
