<td><h2>2020 Annual General Meeting</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2020-06-23 13:40:02</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Golar LNG Limited advises that its 2020 Annual General Meeting will be held on September 24, 2020.  The record date for voting at the Annual General Meeting is set to July 29, 2020.  The notice, agenda and associated material will be distributed prior to the meeting.</p>  <p>Golar LNG Limited<br />Hamilton, Bermuda<br />June 23, 2020</p> <img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMDM1NDA0MSM0MDA2OTkyMzYjMjAwMzUzOQ==" width="1" height="1"/></p></td>
