<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2020-04-30 23:00:02</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Golar LNG Limited announces that it has filed its Form 20-F for the year ended December 31, 2019 with the Securities and Exchange Commission in the U.S.</p>  <p align="justify">Form 20-F can be downloaded from the link below, is available on our website (<a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=pRzskAX1OS4Vnt5KNi_tVQ2Aldd6unbb8nnINqYEboQIMcKMGxNodVUK9aafW6OjT8SKbM7uJQMGNzY4iJALow==" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><u>www.golarlng.com</u></a>) and shareholders may receive a hard copy free of charge upon request.  </p>  <p>April 30, 2020<br /> The Board of Directors<br /> Hamilton, Bermuda<br />Enquiries:<br />Golar Management Limited: + 44 207 063 7900<br />Stuart Buchanan</p> <p id="gnw_attachments_section-header"><br>    <strong>Attachment</strong><br></p><br><ul id="gnw_attachments_section-items"><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/d5b13258-e09f-4330-819e-3b63fd05f623">GLNG 2019 Annual Report Form 20-F</a><br>      </li><br>      </ul><br><img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMDMzNDU4MyM0MDA2NjIyNzMjMjAwMzUzOQ==" width="1" height="1"/></p></td>
