</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify">Further to the press release of July 5, 2019 giving notice that the Golar LNG Limited 2019 Annual General Meeting will be held on September 27, 2019, a copy of the Notice of Annual General Meeting and associated information including the Companys Annual Report on Form 20-F can be found on our website at <a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=nY_67KAhwOkqoqOMQZelkZzZafSOt05-YZNL4fdo-_7xcfNbEwdTCaU9J8XpwkC0xzXa8rmjOaOqnTV_XQOIOWOKKJ1eOeh96rrglypkV5w=" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">http://www.golarlng.com</a> and in the attachments below.</p>  <p>Golar LNG Limited<br />Hamilton, Bermuda<br />August 16, 2019</p> <p id="gnw_attachments_section-header"><br>    <strong>Attachments</strong><br></p><br><ul id="gnw_attachments_section-items"><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/577ad482-e9c2-42b2-b8dc-c2a8f41c20fb">Notice of 2019 Annual General Meeting</a><br>      </li><br>            <li><br>        <a target="_blank" href="https://ml-eu.globenewswire.com/Resource/Download/5c01090c-08cd-48b4-a8ca-1a89ec187006">2018 Annual Report Form 20-F</a><br>      </li><br>      </ul><br><img class="__GNW8366DE3E__IMG" src="https://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/ti?nf=MTAwMDI1NzY1MSM0MDA0NTE3MzcjMjAwMzUzOQ==" width="1" height="1"/></p></td>
