<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Golar LNG Dividend information</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2018-02-28 14:30:02</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p class="hugin">Reference is made to the fourth quarter 2017 report released on February 28, 2018. Golar LNG has declared a total dividend of $0.05 per share to be paid on or about April 4, 2018. The record date will be March 14, 2018. </p> <p class="hugin">Golar LNG Limited<br class="hugin" /> Hamilton, Bermuda<br class="hugin" /> 28 February, 2018</p> <div><img border="0" src="http://thomsonreuterscorporategroup.122.2o7.net/b/ss/trcgclientrs615/1/H.22.1--NS/0?pageName=Golar LNG Dividend information&amp;c1=2172326&amp;c2=D=Referer" width="1" alt="" height="1" /><br /></div><div textcontent="element text"></div><br /><hr /><br /><div name="div_with_disclaimer_name" style="font-size: 10px;" id="div_with_disclaimer_id"><i style="font-size: 10px;">This announcement is distributed by Nasdaq Corporate Solutions on behalf of Nasdaq Corporate Solutions clients.<br />The issuer of this announcement warrants that they are solely responsible for the content, accuracy and originality of the information contained therein.<br />Source: Golar LNG via Globenewswire</i><br /></div></p></td>
