<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Golar LNG Limited - Announcement of filing of Form 20-F Annual Report</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2017-05-01 15:00:02</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p><p align="justify" class="hugin">Golar LNG Limited (&quot;Golar&quot; or the &quot;Company&quot;) announces that it has filed its Form 20-F for the year ended December 31, 2016 with the Securities and Exchange Commission in the U.S.</p> <p class="hugin">Form 20-F can be downloaded from the link below.</p> <p class="hugin"> </p> <p class="hugin">May 1, 2017<br class="hugin" /> The Board of Directors<br class="hugin" /> Golar LNG Limited<br class="hugin" /> Hamilton, Bermuda</p> <div><img border="0" src="http://thomsonreuterscorporategroup.122.2o7.net/b/ss/trcgclientrs615/1/H.22.1--NS/0?pageName=Golar LNG Limited - Announcement of filing of Form 20-F Annual Report&amp;c1=2100687&amp;c2=D=Referer" width="1" alt="" height="1" /><br /></div><div textcontent="element text"><a href="http://hugin.info/133076/R/2100687/796341.pdf">2016 Annual Report Form 20-F</a><br /></div><br /><hr /><br /><div name="div_with_disclaimer_name" style="font-size: 10px;" id="div_with_disclaimer_id"><i style="font-size: 10px;">This announcement is distributed by Nasdaq Corporate Solutions on behalf of Nasdaq Corporate Solutions clients.<br />The issuer of this announcement warrants that they are solely responsible for the content, accuracy and originality of the information contained therein.<br />Source: Golar LNG via Globenewswire</i><br /></div></p></td>
</tr>
